Create.

Look around you. Every object surrounding you — including the phone you are holding right now, the app you are reading this message on, even the clothes you are wearing — were all created by people just like you and me.
Systems are the same.
One day, on a sunny afternoon, someone created a system called “higher education” and named it a university.
I, too, have been following this “university” system for the past 3.5 years.
If all systems were created by other people, then it means we also have the choice to decide which system we want to follow in the future — or to not follow any system at all.
Not choosing any system means creating your own.

Create!